            {
               "text": "### Images from Joya Ceren\n\nThese images are copyright for Joya Ceren and allowed to be used according to the license determined by them.\n\nTo visualize all images, use the left and right arrows on the slide below.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\"><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgJoyaCeren0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgJoyaCeren0', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Indigenous buildings in <i>Joya de Cerén</i>, El Salvador. Photo taken on <htdate0>, during a visit to the site (<htcite0>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Learning from nature - This text explores how knowledge of multiplication could have helped ancient civilizations. (<htcite1>)</li><li>The result is (Phase II) - a game to reinforce the connection between addition and multiplication. (<htcite2>)</li><li>Translation game (Part I) - Explore numbers from different cultures through an engaging translation game. (<htcite3>)</li><li>The result is - a game of consecutive sums that helps uncover the story. (<htcite4>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgJoyaCeren1\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgJoyaCeren1', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Ceramic bowls found at Joya de Cerén, El Salvador. Photo taken on <htdate1>, during a visit to the site (<htcite5>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Limiting - In this study, we establish limitations on sizes, thereby expanding the use of knowledge. (<htcite6>)</li><li>Cooking - The preparation of food is often remembered for adding quantities, but there is also another side to it. (<htcite7>)</li></ul></div></div><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i></div></p>",
